# Testing & build

## Python (pytest)

```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest              # default: -m 'not integration'
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest -m integration  # real-browser CDP tests
```

- Config: `pyproject.toml` (`testpaths = ["tests"]`, `timeout = 60`)
- Integration marker for Chrome/Edge CDP flows

## JavaScript (Vitest)

```powershell
npm test
npm run lint                    # ESLint weight guardrails (warnings)
npm run check:module-size       # js/*.js line cap (3800)
npm run check:bundle-size       # requires npm run build first
```

- Config: `vitest.config.js`
- Tests in `tests/*.test.js` and `tests/js/*.test.js`

## Full suite

```powershell
.\scripts\test-all.ps1   # pytest + JS (CI parity)
```

## Frontend build (optional)

```powershell
npm run build   # esbuild → dist/; server auto-serves when dist/manifest.json exists
```

- Source: `scripts/build-frontend.mjs`
- Tailwind: committed `tailwind.css` (precompiled from `styles/tailwind-input.css`)

## Fetcher audits

- `scripts/audit_fetchers.py`, `tests/test_fetcher_manifest_audit.py` — manifest vs scripts
